VALUES ('loan-packing-involuntary-credit-insurance-', 'Loan Packing (Involuntary Credit Insurance)', 'payment', 'high', 'Lender automatically includes ''optional'' products like credit life, disability, or unemployment insurance in the loan amount without clear disclosure or separate consent.', 'Increases the total loan amount and interest costs for products the borrower may not need, want, or even know they have. It''s a way for lenders to hide additional fees.', 'They sneak extra insurance policies into your loan that you didn''t ask for, which makes your monthly payment and total debt higher.', 'Any add-on products must be presented separately with a clear opt-in and a 30-day ''free look'' cancellation period.', 'We noticed several insurance products bundled into the loan. We''d like these removed and a clear disclosure of all optional fees provided.', 'All optional products, including credit insurance, must be disclosed separately from the principal loan amount. Purchase of such products is not a condition of the loan. Client retains the right to cancel any such product within thirty (30) days for a full refund.', '[0.008106451,0.019764896,0.01271084,0.0100063365,-0.047655232,0.0554016,0.014728756,0.040164374,0.007737545,0.01728797,0.028691983,0.024976417,0.05341156,-0.022429166,0.03644038,-0.015560461,0.0027478165,-0.028191755,-0.07681155,-0.04860983,-0.040318757,0.01946393,0.0010695904,-0.0029459458,-0.0131663615,-0.058670815,-0.055127244,-0.05449512,-0.014997456,-0.11310662,-0.023940954,0.055882458,0.022105029,-0.018807124,-0.040236425,-0.03611612,0.006190844,-0.048842236,0.012035572,-0.043913573,-0.03247651,0.0052481703,-0.05444564,-0.0037233108,-0.0024276888,-0.004053628,0.00089941954,0.012694275,0.011025763,0.08622973,0.050713167,0.023073096,-0.063680515,0.042847164,0.018647822,-0.07230498,0.018823305,-0.010132887,-0.027753334,0.055357855,0.062229075,0.012424177,0.025553169,0.025439624,0.030656785,-0.0041883313,-0.047299206,-0.030595245,-0.07045091,0.01501